{"suttaId":"thag6.9","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1880,1898],"vripara":"423"},"segments":{"thag6.9:0.4":"Purohitaputtajentattheragāthā","thag6.9:1.1":"“Jātimadena mattohaṃ, bhogaissariyena ca;","thag6.9:1.3":"Saṇṭhānavaṇṇarūpena, madamatto acārihaṃ.","thag6.9:2.1":"“Nāttano samakaṃ kañci, atirekaṃ ca maññisaṃ;","thag6.9:2.3":"Atimānahato bālo, patthaddho ussitaddhajo.","thag6.9:3.1":"“Mātaraṃ pitarañcāpi, aññepi garusammate;","thag6.9:3.3":"Na kañci abhivādesiṃ, mānatthaddho anādaro.","thag6.9:4.1":"“Disvā vināyakaṃ aggaṃ, sārathīnaṃ varuttamaṃ;","thag6.9:4.3":"Tapantamiva ādiccaṃ, bhikkhusaṅghapurakkhataṃ.","thag6.9:5.1":"“Mānaṃ madañca chaḍḍetvā, vippasannena cetasā;","thag6.9:5.3":"Sirasā abhivādesiṃ, sabbasattānamuttamaṃ.","thag6.9:6.1":"“Atimāno ca omāno, pahīnā susamūhatā;","thag6.9:6.3":"Asmimāno samucchinno, sabbe mānavidhā hatā”ti.","thag6.9:6.5":"… Jento purohitaputto thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
